 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "15m: a bar sweeps the most recent unswept confirmed 2/2 swing low (short-term low run) while reaching a 1h POI: prior trading day low, or an active bullish 1h FVG (formed <=24 1h bars ago, not closed through); mirrored for shorts",
